    "chunk_text": "er & Aaron ahof up his hand ofer eal Egypta w\u00e6teru, & \u00fea froxas astigon up ofer eal Egypta land. Witodlice Pharao clypode Moyse & Aaron, & cw\u00e6\u00f0 to him: Bidda\u00fe eowerne Drihten \u00fe\u00e6t he adrife \u00dea cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses to Pharaone: Gesete me andagan, hw\u00e6nne \u00f0u wille \u00fe\u00e6t ic for \u00fee gebidde & for \u00fein \u00d0a andswarode Pharao & cw\u00e6\u00f0: Nu to morgen; \u00f0a cw\u00e6\u00f0 Moyses: Ic do neah \u00f0am \u00fee \u00f0u cw\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t & \u00fea froxas fara\u00fe fram \u00fee & fram \u00feinum \u00feegnum. \u00d0a eode Moyses & Aaron ut fram Pharaone, & Moyses clypode to Drihtne for \u00f0am wordum \u00fee he & Drihten dide eal swa Moyses b\u00e6d, & \u00fea froxas wurdon deade on heora husum & on heora \u00e6cerum. \u00dea Farao geseah \u00fe\u00e6t he reste h\u00e6fde, he ahyrde hys heortan, & ne let hi faran swa Drihten hym & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Cwe\u00f0 to Aarone: Ahef \u00feine gyrde & sleah on eor\u00f0an, \u00fe\u00e6t gn\u00e6ttas & Aaron ahefde up hys hand, & sloh mid \u00fe\u00e6re gyrde on \u00fea eor\u00f0an, & gn\u00e6ttas w\u00e6ron gewordene on \u00d0a cw\u00e6don \u00fea dryas to Pharaone: \u00feis is Godes miht; & his heorte wear\u00f0 ahyrd, & he hi ne gehyrde & Drihten cw\u00e6\u00f0 to Moyse: Aris on d\u00e6gred & stand beforan Pharaone: so\u00felice he g\u00e6\u00f0 ut to \u00feam & gyf \u00f0u hit ne forl\u00e6tst, witodlice is sende on \u00f0e & on",
